  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Auburn, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About Auburn   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Contact Us  \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Auburn Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registration & Renewals \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t New Residents \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registrations \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Voter Registration & Voting \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nOverview \nThe Town Clerk is responsible under a variety of state laws for several functions, including: \nKeep all town records \nCertify the actions of selectmen and other town officials \nMake official reports \nCollect fees \nServe as an election official \nRecord all votes passed by the town \nRegister motor vehicles, boats, and trailers \nLicense dogs \nIssue and record vital records (births, marriages, and deaths). \nThe Town Clerk is elected to office and serves a three-year term (RSA 41:16). The Town Clerk may appoint a Deputy Town Clerk with the approval of the Board of Selectmen. The Deputy must be \"qualified in the same manner\" as the Clerk (RSA 41:18). \nIn Auburn, the Town Clerk has been authorized by the NH Department of Safety, Division of Motor Vehicles, to register motor vehicles on behalf of the State. As such, the Auburn Town Clerk's office can handle both the local and state portions of motor vehicle registrations as a one-stop shop. Without this authorization, residents would have to come first to the Town Hall to handle the local portion of the registration, and then go to an NHDMV Office to handle the state portion. \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 47 Chester Road \n\t\t\t\t\t\t PO Box 309 \n\t\t\t\t\t Auburn ,  NH   03032 \r\n47 Chester Road PO Box 309 Auburn NH 03032 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  603-483-2281  Ext. 2 \r\nHours of Operation: \nMon  9am - 7pm \nTue    Closed \nWed 8am - 3pm \nThu   8am -3pm \nFri     8am - 2pm \r\n\t\t\t\t\tCaitlyn  Folia\r\nTown Clerk\t \r\nEmail  \r\nPhone:  (603) 483-2281 \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Directory & Hours \r\n\t\t\t Auto Registration \r\n\t\t\t Voter Registration \r\n\t\t\t Parks & Rec \r\n\t\t\t Transfer Station \r\nTown of Auburn  \r\n47 Chester Road   \r\nAuburn NH 03032  \r\nPhone:  603-483-5052  \r\n         Home \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Site Map \n         Copyright Notices \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
